WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.813
Install the Scry skill with npx skills add,

2
00:00:03.863 --> 00:00:07.980
then ask your assistant to set up Scry capture.

3
00:00:08.030 --> 00:00:14.571
It adds a screen registry, capture tests and scripts, and two dev dependencies.

4
00:00:14.621 --> 00:00:17.146
Nothing under lib changes.

5
00:00:17.196 --> 00:00:22.070
With no device on this machine it used the headless path,

6
00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:27.120
ran the capture and a dry run, and left the upload to you.

